      "webpage": {
        "text": "2013 NFL Cheerleaders: Best of Week 11\n\nNFL Photos | NFL Photography Gallery | NFL.com\n\n1 / 29\n\nRedskins Eagles Football\n\nA Philadelphia Eagles cheerleader performs during the first half of an NFL football game against the Washington Redskins in Philadelphia, Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013. (AP Photo/Matt Slocum)\n\nMatt Slocum\n\n2 / 29\n\nCardinals Jaguars Football\n\nJacksonville Jaguars cheerleaders performduring the first half of an NFL football game against the Arizona Cardinals in Jacksonville, Fla., Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013.(AP Photo/Stephen Morton)\n\nStephen Morton\n\n3 / 29\n\nCardinals Jaguars Football\n\nJacksonville Jaguars cheerleaders perform during the first half of an NFL football game against the Arizona Cardinals in Jacksonville, Fla., Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013.(AP Photo/Phelan M. Ebenhack)\n\nPhelan M. Ebenhack\n\n4 / 29\n\nFalcons Buccaneers Football\n\nA Tampa Bay Buccaneers cheerleader before an NFL football game against the Atlanta Falcons Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Tampa, Fla. (AP Photo/Chris O'Meara)\n\nChris O'Meara\n\n5 / 29\n\n[No Title]\n\nA fan poses with Buffalo Bills cheerleader before an NFL football game between the Buffalo Bills and the New York Jets on Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Orchard Park, N.Y. (AP Photo/Gary Wiepert)\n\nGary Wiepert\n\n6 / 29\n\nFalcons Buccaneers Football\n\nTampa Bay Buccaneers cheerleaders during the second quarter of an NFL football game against the Atlanta Falcons Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Tampa, Fla. (AP Photo/Brian Blanco)\n\nBrian Blanco\n\n7 / 29\n\nCincinnati Bengals cheerleaders\n\nCincinnati Bengals cheerleaders perform during an NFL football game against the Cleveland Browns, Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Cincinnati. (AP Photo/Al Behrman)\n\nAl Behrman\n\n8 / 29\n\nRaiders Texans Football\n\nHouston Texans cheerleaders dress in Armed Forces clothes during the first half of an NFL football game against the Oakland Raiders Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Houston. (AP Photo/Patric Schneider)\n\nPatric Schneider\n\n9 / 29\n\nBrowns Bengals Football\n\nCincinnati Bengals cheerleaders perform during an NFL football game against the Cleveland Browns, Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Cincinnati. (AP Photo/Tom Uhlman)\n\nTom Uhlman\n\n10 / 29\n\nFalcons Buccaneers Football\n\nA Tampa Bay Buccaneers cheerleader before an NFL football game against the Atlanta Falcons Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Tampa, Fla. (AP Photo/Chris O'Meara)\n\nChris O'Meara\n\n11 / 29\n\nRaiders Texans Football\n\nHouston Texans cheerleaders dress in Armed Forces clothes during the first half of an NFL football game against the Oakland Raiders Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Houston. (AP Photo/Patric Schneider)\n\nPatric Schneider\n\n12 / 29\n\nJets Bills Football\n\nA Buffalo Bills cheerleader stands on the field during the first half of an NFL football game against the New York Jets on Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Orchard Park, N.Y. (AP Photo/Heather Ainsworth)\n\nHeather Ainsworth\n\n13 / 29\n\nRaiders Texans Football\n\nHouston Texans cheerleaders dress in Armed Forces clothes during the first half of an NFL football game against the Oakland Raiders Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Houston. (AP Photo/Patric Schneider)\n\nPatric Schneider\n\n14 / 29\n\nJets Bills Football\n\nBuffalo Bills cheerleaders perform during the second half of an NFL football game against the New York Jets on Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Orchard Park, N.Y. (AP Photo/Gary Wiepert)\n\nGary Wiepert\n\n15 / 29\n\nRaiders Texans Football\n\nHouston Texans cheerleaders during the second half of an NFL football game against the Oakland Raiders Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Houston. (AP Photo/Patric Schneider)\n\nPatric Schneider\n\n16 / 29\n\n49ers Saints Football\n\nA New Orleans Saints cheerleader perfroms in the first half of an NFL football game against the San Francisco 49ers in New Orleans, Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013. (AP Photo/Dave Martin)\n\nDave Martin\n\n17 / 29\n\nFalcons Buccaneers Footbal\n\nA Tampa Bay Buccaneers cheerleader during the second quarter of an NFL football game against the Atlanta Falcons Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Tampa, Fla. (AP Photo/Brian Blanco)\n\nBrian Blanco\n\n18 / 29\n\nChargers Dolphins Football\n\nA Miami Dolphins cheerleader waits to perform during the first half of an NFL football game against the San Diego Chargers, Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Miami Gardens, Fla. (AP Photo/Wilfredo Lee)\n\nWilfredo Lee\n\n19 / 29\n\n49ers Saints Football\n\nThe New Orleans Saints cheerleaders perform during a game against the San Francisco 49ers at the Mercedes-Benz Superdome on Sunday November 17, 2013 in New Orleans, Louisiana. (Aaron M. Sprecher/NFL)\n\nAaron M. Sprecher\n\n20 / 29\n\n49ers Saints Football\n\nThe New Orleans Saints cheerleaders perform during a game against the San Francisco 49ers at the Mercedes-Benz Superdome on Sunday November 17, 2013 in New Orleans, Louisiana. (Aaron M. Sprecher/NFL)\n\nAaron M. Sprecher\n\n21 / 29\n\n[No Title]\n\nA Philadelphia Eagles cheerleader performs during the second half of an NFL football game against the Washington Redskins in Philadelphia, Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013. (AP Photo/Matt Slocum)\n\nMatt Slocum\n\n22 / 29\n\n[No Title]\n\nHouston Texans cheerleaders during the second half of an NFL football game against the Oakland Raiders Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Houston. (AP Photo/Tony Gutierrez)\n\nTony Gutierrez\n\n23 / 29\n\n[No Title]\n\nJacksonville Jaguars cheerleaders perform during the first half of an NFL football game against the Arizona Cardinals in Jacksonville, Fla., Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013.(AP Photo/Phelan M. Ebenhack)\n\nPhelan M. Ebenhack\n\n24 / 29\n\nSeattle Seahawks Sea Gals\n\nSeattle Seahawks Sea Gals cheerleaders perform during an NFL football game against the Minnesota Vikings, Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Seattle. (AP Photo/Ted S. Warren)\n\nTed S. Warren\n\n25 / 29\n\nMiami Dolphins cheerleader\n\nA Miami Dolphins cheerleader performs during the first half of an NFL football game against the San Diego Chargers, Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Miami Gardens, Fla. (AP Photo/Wilfredo Lee)\n\nWilfredo Lee\n\n26 / 29\n\nNew Orleans Saints cheerleaders\n\nNew Orleans Saints cheerleaders perform in the first half of an NFL football game against the San Francisco 49ers in New Orleans, Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013. (AP Photo/Bill Haber)\n\nBill Haber\n\n27 / 29\n\nSeattle Seahawks Sea Gals\n\nSeattle Seahawks Sea Gals cheerleaders perform during an NFL football game against the Minnesota Vikings, Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Seattle. (AP Photo/Ted S. Warren)\n\nTed S. Warren\n\n28 / 29\n\nJacksonville Jaguars cheerleaders\n\nA member of the Jacksonville Jaguars cheerleaders perform during the second half of an NFL football game, Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Jacksonville, Fla. The Cardinals beat the Jaguars 27-14. (AP Photo/Stephen Morton)\n\nStephen Morton\n\n29 / 29\n\nDenver Broncos cheerleader\n\nA Denver Broncos cheerleader performs before an NFL football game against the Kansas City Chiefs, Sunday, Nov. 17, 2013, in Denver. (AP Photo/Joe Mahoney)\n\nJoe Mahoney\n\nAdvertising",
